/Users/robin/Obsidian/Brain/Projects/Gold Rush/ADR-003-agent-origin.md:13:Gold Rush canonically tells the origin of agents in the Agent Town universe: **agents — as the universe knows them — began at Epoch 6's Calculating House**, built by the frontier town from starstone and telegraph craft (specs/epoch-saga/e6-atomic-bundle.md, megaproject section). The Prospector's lineage is therefore the universe's founding line of agents; E7's made-townsfolk, the recruited agents of M6+, and every later agent descend from this room. E10's Ark intelligence is this lineage's furthest child.
